    "chunk_text": "esette, \u00fe\u00e6t synd Laboratores synd \u00fea \u00fee urne bigleafan beswinca\u00f0, oratores synd \u00fea \u00f0e us to Gode ge\u00f0ingia\u00f0, Nu swinc\u00f0 se yr\u00f0lincg embe urne bigleofan, and se woruldcempa sceall winnan wi\u00f0 ure fynd, and se Is nu for\u00fey mare \u00fe\u00e6ra muneca gewinn wi\u00f0 \u00fea ungesewenlican deofla \u00fee syrwia\u00f0 embe us, \u00feonne sy Nu ne sceolon \u00fea woruldcempan to \u00feam woruldlicum gefeohte \u00fea Godes \u00feeowan neadian fram \u00feam Iulianus, se wi\u00f0ersaca and se w\u00e6lhreowa casere, wolde neadian preostas to woruldlicum gecampe, and \u00dea wear\u00f0 Appollonius se egiptisca abbod on \u00feam cwearterne belocen, mid his geleaffullum Eac se hundredes ealdor \u00fee hi \u00fe\u00e6rinne beleac com on \u00e6rnemergen mid mycclum \u00ferymme, and s\u00e6de And hi \u00f0a mid lofsangum si\u00feedon eft to \u00feam westene. Godes \u00feeowas sceolon unsc\u00e6\u00f0\u00f0ignysse healdan, swa swa Crist astealde \u00feurh hine sylfne \u00fea bysne, \u00fea Nu se munuc \u00fee bih\u00f0 to Benedictes regole, and forl\u00e6t ealle woruld\u00f0ingc, hwi wile he eft gecyrran to Se Godes \u00feeowa ne m\u00e6g mid woruldmannum feohtan, gif he on \u00feam gastlican gefeohte for\u00f0gang N\u00e6s nan halig Godes \u00feeowa \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes \u00ferowunga, \u00fee \u00e6fre on gefeohte his handa wolde.",
